ADVANCING AUSTRALIA’S AI GUARDRAILS  
 
ROANNE MONTE*, JONATHAN VORIS†, and ALAN AMBRON‡ 
 
I INTRODUCTION  
 
This submission is in respectful response to the Department of Science, Industry and Resources’ 
(DISR) Safe and Responsible AI in Australia: Proposals Paper for Introducing Mandatory 
Guardrails for AI in High-Risk Settings  (Proposal ) by Armatec Global .1 Armatec Global is an 
Australian -founded impact technology company that provides its Capchr® threat intelligence 
platform to the private and public sectors.  
 
