Consultation on the introduction of mandatory guardrails for AI in high-risk settings  
 AI technologies have en ormous potential to improve productivity  and effi ciency for the benefit of all 
workers , but only where there is appropriate regulation.  The FSU supports the et hical, sustainable use 
