‘Computational Methods for Improving the Observability of Platform-Based Advertising’ (2024) Journal of Advertising, 
doi:10.1080/00913367.2024.2394156.
64J. Burgess, N. Carah, D. Angus, A. Obeid, M. Andrejevic, ‘Why Am I Seeing This Ad? The affordances and limits of 
