certification)  
 Support material which describes inappropriate and appropriate use of AI in high -risk 
settings  
 Regulators working with professional organisations such as PSA to support timely 
communication and dissemination of information  and guidance  to health practitioners to 
facilitate effective implementation of any regulatory arrangements  
