it to non-human decision -makers  is a significant  challenge .79  
 
Guardrail 7 would hand over  responsibility for protecting democratic workplace democracy 
to employers  and employers alone . Anyone who has ever had to use  the complaints 
handling process of a tech company would understand the difficulty in mounting 
challenges . Contestability  in this model  is internal. If a worker has  been harmed by an 
automated decision, they will  need to go to the harming employer  and ask them to hear 
the claim.80 When contesting the decision, the employer  will also decid e what information 
workers will  get access  to.81 
 
