of individual developers . Deployers and integrators of these technologies 
must take responsibility for these changes.   
 
The TGA has requirement s in place for personalised medical devices and point of care manufacturing 
that can provide a useful resource  in this area  
https://www.tga.gov.au/how -we-regulate/manufacturing/manufacture -medical -device/point -care -
