Conclusion  
MTAA commends the Australian Government on the request for input on how to mandate guardrails 
on those developing and deploying AI in Australia in high -risk settings . While much work remains  to 
support the ever -increasing adoption of AI in Australia, it is encouraging to see the commitment of 
government to address the use of AI in high -risk settings . 
 
MTAA and our member companies look forward to the continued collaboration and engagement on 
AI related issues and practices. We welcome further discussions with the Department of Industry, 
Science and Resources as they become available and encourage the re view of our more detailed 
response to the TGA Consultation - Clarifying and strengthening the regulation of Artificial Intelligence 
(AI) to be submitted 13 October 2024 . 
    
 
 
  
