responsible -use-ai-australia.html . 
  
 3 
 
 
We have reviewed the Department’s proposal and welcome the opportunity to share our 
views on the following three topics it outlines:  
 
• Defining high -risk AI;  
• Guardrails ensuring testing, transparency & accountability of AI; and  
• Regulatory options to mandate guardrails.  
Clarity on each of these topics will provide  the necessary direction to organisations by 
indicating what they can start doing today to prepare for Australia’s AI -driven future.  
 
This submission shares an overview of AI more broadly, our views on the above topics, 
followed by some closing comments.  
 
We welcome the opportunity to discuss our views further with you.  
 
 
 
 
    
 
