o The s everity of the disease or condition use of the device is intended for 
o Whether the device is intended for use by a consumer or clinician 
• Legislative requirements for general and specific characteristics relating to 
safety, performance, design, and construction , known as the “essential 
principles”4. Explicit principles relating to software as a medical device include 
requirements for:  
 
