2. Post-market (ex post) requirements 
Once a device has met all relevant regulatory requirements and has been approved for supply in Australia, there are post -market conditions and requirements imposed on the 
manufacturer and sponsor that require ongoing monitoring of device performance and the undertaking of corrective action where required.  
These measures include the following automatic conditions for sponsors of medical devices:  
• Facilitating access to the technical documentation that demonstrates compliance with the essential principles.  
• Facilitating access to the evidence that appropriate conformity assessment documentation or market authorisation evidence has been obtained.  
 
