During the targeted stakeholder workshops, a large number of  participants were in agreement that the 
TGA’s existing regulatory framework is already quite robust due to the flexibility afforded by its 
technology -agnostic approach. Stakeholders further noted that many of the issues associated with 
regulation of AI can be attributed to a lack of education, communication, information and guidance 
