development, ensuring that First Nations voices are actively involved in decisions abou t 
how AI interacts with their knowledge systems and cultural heritage. This can prevent 
misappropriation of traditional knowledge and ensure AI systems reflect cultural Public Submission : Introducing mandatory guardrails for AI in high -risk settings  
