between stages in the lifecycle, ensuring no gaps in accountability. A flex ible mechanism 
should be in place to reassign responsibilities if significant modifications are made post -
deployment, ensuring continuous risk management and compliance.  Public Submission : Introducing mandatory guardrails for AI in high -risk settings  
