should
also
be
a
factor
in
the
obligations
imposed
on
AI.
The
basis
of
risk
management
is
that
more
significant
risks
should
be
subject
to
more
significant
mitigations.
A
risk-based
approach
to
regulating
AI
should
be
the
same.
