Engage Industry-Specific Experts 2.
Form advisory panels or working groups for each sector, involving industry experts,
academia, and civil society.a.
Collaborate with AI developers and deployers to ensure trials reflect real-world
challenges and assess if the guardrails meet specific industry needs.b.
Develop Pilot Programs 3.
Launch pilot programs in key industries: a.
Healthcare: Trial digital attestations for AI-generated patient data, ensuring human
review and sign-off.i.
Finance: Test blockchain for tamper-proof AI decision records, ensuring traceability
and privacy.ii.
Assess AI’s impact on decision-making, the effectiveness of human oversight, and
