applications like Photoshop, Illustrator and Adobe Express . Adobe has also announced its intent to 
release Firefly GAI models in additional modalities, including video, audio and 3D.  
 
We believe that Al done right will amplify human creativity and capabilities to new levels with 
deeper insights, accelerated task performance, and improved decision -making ability. As we 
continue to harness the power of Al, we are committed to developing a nd deploying Al in line with 
our Al Ethics principles4 of accountability, responsibility, and transparency, while considering its 
broader impact on society.  
 
Adobe’s Comments  
 
Adobe suppor ts the establishment of a clear  and coherent  framework for  AI regulation to support 
innovation following an approach that is risk -base d and harmonized  with global regulations . We 
appreciate that DISR’s proposed  approach is focused on  high -risk use cases  and leverages 
concepts from  similar frameworks in the EU, US and Canada.  
 
In response to the approach outlined in the Proposals Paper  as well as the questions for 
consultation , we offer the following  thoughts  on select  sections  for your consideration.  
 
