assumes
universal
traits
and
pre-decided
categories
and
transforms
social
constructs
such
as
those
mentioned
above
into
‘objective’
truths.
Thus,
it
removes
one
of
the
most
fundamental
of
human
rights
—
the
right
to
express
one’s
identity.
Profiles
predicting
behavior
based
on
these
categories
further
violate
the
presumption
of
innocence.
