DLC Legal extends its boutique legal and strategic services to Australian managed IT 
providers, emphasising support in privacy and cybersecurity with clients and partners 
specialising in technical cyber support and insider threat detection technology. Our 
advisory services are designed to address the unique challenges faced by the IT and 
