or
more
FHCA
course
(GDPR,
Children’s
Code,
Disability
Inclusion
and
Accessibility,
NYC
AEDT
Bias
Audit,
or
EU
AI
Act).
FHCAs
also
agree
to
remain
current
on
the
law,
regulatory
guidance,
best
practices
and
industry
standards
associated
with
audit
compliance
