and
review
the
appeal.
No
conflicts
of
interest
will
be
permitted
in
consideration
of
the
appeal.
The
considerations
for
the
appeal
will
be
based
on
the
following
criteria:
1)
Is
the
scheme
approved
by
a
government
authority
and
might
require
additional
input
should
a
change
be
merited?
2)
What
is
the
best
interest
of
humanity
with
regards
to
the
appeal?
