What
maximises
the
ability
of
the
auditee
to
mitigate
their
risks?
4)
What
maximises
the
ability
of
the
Certification
Body
to
minimise
their
risk
associated
with
assurance?
Appeals
will
be
noted
in
writing
to
the
entity
which
has
requested
the
appeal.
