and
Auditees
will
be
notified
and
ForHumanity
may
choose
to
apply
the
appeal
to
all
aspects
of
the
audit
until
it
can
be
amended
through
the
formal
audit
update
process.
Appeals
will
be
held
in
effect
for
one
year.
Any
extension
to
an
appeal
resides
in
the
sole
discretion
of
ForHumanity.
