Ethical
Choice
ForHumanity
identified
a
common
flaw
in
algorithm
development
-
organisation’s
regularly
have
failed
to
incorporate
experts
in
ethics
in
the
creation
of
socio-technical
systems,
like
artificial
intelligence.
These
systems
are
often
filled
with
instances
of
ethical
choice,
ranging
from
benchmarking
for
data
representativeness
to
threshold
levels
for
