diverse voices and perspectives to ensure that AGI is developed in a way that reflects our shared values and 
aspirations. (Johnson, L. (2023). 
Ultimately, the existential importance for creating Benevolent Beneficial AGI is a call to action for humanity as a 
whole. It is a reminder that the choices we make today will shape the future of our species and our planet. By 
embracing this imperative and working together to create AGI that is aligned with our values, we can pave the way 
for a future where technology serves as a force for good, enriching and enhancing the human experience in ways we 
