risk applications that warrant additional safeguards.
3. Recognizing the difficulty of reversing or remediating adverse outcomes emphasizes the need for proactive risk mitigation measures.
4. Applying the high-risk designation irrespective of scale, purpose, or technical limitations acknowledges that even narrow or limited AI systems can pose 
